@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Abrir conta (copie o id retornado para @source / @destination)
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ownerName": "Maria Silva", "currency": "BRL" }

###
@source = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@destination = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Depositar R$ 100,00 (envie duas vezes: a segunda resposta é um replay)
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{source}}/deposits
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: deposit-001

{ "amount": 10000 }

### Transferir R$ 25,00
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: transfer-001

{ "sourceAccountId": "{{source}}", "destinationAccountId": "{{destination}}", "amount": 2500 }

### Saldo
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{source}}

### Extrato
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{source}}/statement?page=1&pageSize=20
